{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your own personal shrine on your desktop \u2014 a touch of daily ritual and gentle fortune.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Desktop Shrine</i> is a relaxing interactive experience that brings a piece of spiritual calm to your workspace. Click to pray, draw your daily fortune, or place omamori charms on your screen for good luck. Just a few seconds each day can brighten your mood with a kind word and a little divine support.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Instructions</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jinja placed on the desktop, can be dragged to any location</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731430/extras/eed55c1a818eb0eb30c637f64e8bab85.poster.avif?t=1748343253\" width=388 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731430/extras/eed55c1a818eb0eb30c637f64e8bab85.webm?t=1748343253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731430/extras/eed55c1a818eb0eb30c637f64e8bab85.mp4?t=1748343253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click to pray or draw your daily fortune</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731430/extras/ee09ab2495bad7c6a3a2ee8e9606b5ab.poster.avif?t=1748343253\" width=478 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731430/extras/ee09ab2495bad7c6a3a2ee8e9606b5ab.webm?t=1748343253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731430/extras/ee09ab24